window.products.push({"id":338163,"name":"Department 56 Rudolph The Red-Nosed Reindeer 2022 Dated Ornament Hanging Ornament, 2.95 Inch, Multicolor,Christmas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Pr4wjTqsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer and his shiny nose has been proudly leading Santa's sleigh around the world for ages! Rudolph and his \"deerest\" friends work tirelessly to bring everyone the joy of Christmas. Spread their cheer by adding this cast of characters to your home, in a series of holiday figurines and ornaments. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Snowbabies, Possible Dreams, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Pr4wjTqsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B09S166Y2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S166Y2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S166Y2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338164,"name":"K&B Glass Rinser Drip Tray - Variations (Center Spray Glass Rinser Drip Tray, 15\" L x 7\" W)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7118mUUFIcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keg & Brew Supplies is a full service provider of quality draft beer equipment at affordable prices. From Conception to Consumption, we’ve got you covered. Keg & Brew Supplies works with our trusted manufacturers at Krome Dispense and proudly provides custom combinations with their quality made products. Check out our amazon store for our full product line.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7118mUUFIcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"K&B Supplies","source_asin":"B0842BQBT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842BQBT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842BQBT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338165,"name":"Café Romeo Juliet's Tears 6 Cup Linden Frame Cold Water Drip Brew Dutch Coffee Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TWmu2n8LL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Origin of Dutch was the extraction method found out by former dutch colonial merchants to keep and drink coffee for a long time during the transportation of coffee from Indonesia to Europe. Now, Café Romeo Original produces an Acid free coffee and it is very convenient to adjust the water drip speed. The classic cold water drip method produces full-flavored superfine coffee for making iced beverages and for use in recipes. The classic brewing system brings out coffee's flavor and aroma by slowly dripping cold water through finely ground beans. The results of coffee flavor are fantastic at home. Please keep refrigerated up to 7 days for better unique flavor. Don’t be afraid to take a creative experience and adventurous taste of “The Wine of Coffee”. Features of Dutch Coffee - For Extraction, drop the cold water at room temperature for 6 ~ 12 hours. - It has almost no caffeine per cup, has less astringent, and barely any tannin tastes under 5 degree. - It’s less Acid, which many people find helpful to their stomach. - It tastes like plenty of fruit with a smooth flavor that lasts long. - The cold-brew method is less bitter, which promotes a smooth flavor. - The cold-brew method allows a different flavor profile to appear. Dutch Coffee Recipe - 1. Dutch Straight: You can enjoy the extracted Dutch Coffee like warm/hot espresso by reheating. - 2. Dutch Americano/Classic Dutch: Mix extracted Dutch Coffee, 50ml, and pure water, 150ml. If you’d like the Classic Dutch, add ice to the mixed recipe. If you choose the Dutch Americano, reheat the mixed recipe. - 3. Dutch Café Ou Lait: Mix extracted Dutch Coffee, 50ml, and milk, 100ml, and then place the milk foam to the top of the mixed recipe. - 4. Dutch Shakerato: Put some shredded ice and extracted Dutch Coffee, 50ml in a shaker, shake it shake it several times, place it in a separate glass, then enjoy it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TWmu2n8LL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cafe Romeo","source_asin":"B00JBFXDIQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JBFXDIQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JBFXDIQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
