window.products.push({"id":338170,"name":"MALOUF STEELOCK Hook-in Headboard-Footboard Heavy Duty Steel Frame-Metal Bed Rails, King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tBj3OD8oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"support your mattress with the sturdiest bed frame design Available. The unique wedge lock connectors of the Street-Lock frame become stronger as more weight is applied and can support virtually any practical weight. The center support bar is 2hes wide and made from double rail angle iron. Side rails with protective end caps and cross arms are both 1. 5 inches by 1. 5 inches. Powder coated in a stylish black matte finish. universal use This adaptable frame is designed to fit most headboards and footboards. Bolt on brackets create a secure connection for headboards and footboards that affix with bolts. This frame also includes four bolt-to-hook modification plates to accommodate hook-on headboards and footboards. These mode plates can be micro-adjusted to fit most headboards. Adjustable-height glide feet adjust from 4. 5 inches to 7 inches to allow for headboard/footboard Height matching and stabilizing. This frame is also a stronger, more stable alternative to bed Rails. the Street-Lock bed frame assembles easily in seconds with absolutely no tools. Frame features a lifetime U. S. Manufacturer's against defects and workmanship. extra long rails the side rails of this bed frame are longer than those on a standard bed frame. The structures bed frame is designed to be used with a Headboard and footboard. A longer frame makes it easier to make the bed when a headboard and footboard are attached. The extra length gives you more space at the top and Bottom of the mattress to tuck sheets, blankets and comforters down and out of sight. If you do not plan to attach a HEADBOARD and footboard to the bed frame, we suggest you purchase a frame with standard length side rails, such as the structures universal bed frame: Http: //amzn. To/2Akmqvr. Use as standalone bed frame or in place of bed rails for additional support","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tBj3OD8oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B01706U1VY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01706U1VY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01706U1VY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338171,"name":"TreeLen Wipeable Vinyl Tablecloth 54inx78in Waterproof Oil-Proof Spill-Proof Tablecloth Turquoise & Khaqi Plaid Table Cloth for Dining Table and Outdo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W1BFLtdCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stain Resistant Vinyl Tablecloth - Vinyl material rectangle tablecloth feature spill-proof oil-proof and fade-proof,providing you convenience to clean the tablecloth. Durable - Made of heavy vinyl material ensure this waterproof tablecloth can be long lasting use. Size Guidance of Tablecloth - This buffalo plaid tablecloth is designed to fit 54 x 78 inch tablecloth is suitable for 36\"x60\" to 48\"x72\" table. Multi Purposes - TreeLen tablecloth is perfect for dining table,card table,kitchen,cafes,restaurants,parties,picnic,camping and also outdoor using. Easy to Care - You just use a wet cloth to wipe off the stains on the tablecloth at ease.Do not bleach & machine wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W1BFLtdCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeLen","source_asin":"B08R5CFXDD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R5CFXDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R5CFXDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338172,"name":"Spiral Slicer Spiralizer Complete Bundle - Best Vegetable Spiralizer and Cutter - Zucchini Pasta Noodle Spaghetti Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mda0aWVHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Are you ready to make small changes to improve your health? Our vegetable spiralizer gets you started on the right track. We provide the tools you need to make small lifestyle changes that stick. Many people want to change their eating habits but fail because of the time involved in preparing food from scratch. That’s why we encourage our customers to take small steps to improve their health, even just by adding one fruit and vegetable to their diet daily. And no, potato fries don’t count, but you could make curly fries on one of those cheat days!  Four interchangeable blades  Straight blade to slice 3 mm blade to shred and grate 5 mm blade for spiralizing 10-mm blade for linguine How to Use  Cuts vegetables less than 2.5 inches in diameter—most carrots, cucumbers, and radishes and small sweet potatoes, zucchini, and beets. Gently push the handguard in until it will not go in any farther. Be careful of the sharp blades, and never put your fingers inside! Do not cut the ends off soft vegetables like zucchini. Push the handguard into one end, and then you can spiralize it to the very end with minimal waste. Use vegetable cores for stock, fried rice, baby food, or soup. Cleaning brush included. Dishwasher safe If you want a convenient spiralizer for small-scale food preparation, you need Manifold Home Products’ Vegetable Spiralizer. Invest in your health and wellbeing and buy one for yourself today! Better yet, buy two and give one as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mda0aWVHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AXRASER","source_asin":"B07L685L44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L685L44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L685L44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
