window.products.push({"id":338185,"name":"LE TAUCI French Onion Soup Bowls With Handles, 15 Ounce for Soup, chili, beef stew, Set of 4, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716lXP5XZvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Why do you need two holes on the handles?】The two-hole design enables water to drain out. We used to have only one hole on the handle. However, many customers said water was trapped in the handle after cleaning. So we updated it to a two-hole version. After cleaning, you could try to drain the water through the two holes. 【Multi use kitchen stars】 Although it is originally and specifically designed for French Onion Soup it is also for chili, beef stew, bouillon, seafood bisque, chowder, lobster bisque, shepherds pie, cheese soup, tortilla soup, and more. 15 OZ soup bowl is an ideal size to make everyone enjoy their own soup without worrying over-eat. 【Stackable & space-saving】 Highly stackable and they cozy up comfortably in the cabinets. The glazed ceramic is resistant to odor and stains which can last for years. The glazed bottoms make it easy to clean. Just pop them in the dishwasher. 【Convenient design】 The french onion soup bowls come with side handle, make your onion soup bowl easy-to-grip and comfortable to use. When your soup bowls comes out from the heat of oven, you can simply grab the handle with your oven mitts. 【Reliable ceramic quality】The ceramic product is high-fire using natural clay, water and gas. It’s made to tolerate high temperatures up to 482°F. Fridge safe and microwave/oven safe. Compared to plastic or stainless steel one, ceramic is free of heavy metals and doesn’t absorb food odors or flavors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716lXP5XZvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LE TAUCI","source_asin":"B0BXSN9HR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXSN9HR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXSN9HR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
