window.products.push({"id":338234,"name":"Merax Retro Console Table Sofa Table for Entryway with 4 Front Facing Storage Drawers and Shelf Living Room Table for Living Room, Entryway (Antique W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":157.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OXkMfPrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☞【Vintage Style Console Table】The classic accent table is perfect for any decorating style, and the wood material design shows the American country style. In addition, it has four drawers that can hold many daily necessities. It adds a rustic touch to the room while keeping it tidy. ☞【Meet Various Storage Needs】With 4 front storage drawers and a spacious bottom shelf and upper countertop, this console table has plenty of storage options to choose from, making it a practical household item. Drawers can be used to store small items, and the bottom shelf and upper countertop can be used to display your favorite decorations such as paintings, photos, flowers and more. ☞【Multifunctional Console Table】This wooden table can not only be used as a console table, sideboard. You can also use it as a side table, display stand, bathroom cabinet, bookcase and more to meet your various needs. Drawers and shelves can provide extra space for books, plants, decorations, and more. No matter where you put it, it's a highlight! ☞【MADE FOR QUALITY】This console table is carefully crafted with high quality MDF, Rubberwood and Acacia wood for reliable construction and long service life. The solid wood frame and legs also make the console look more valuable. The table top can hold up to 220 lbs, the drawer can up to 30lbs and the shelf can up to 30lbs. ☞【Size and Assembly】Overall: 15''D x 63''W x 35.4''H. Overall Weight: 80 LBS. Shelf: 14.1''D x 61.4''W x 1.18''H. Side Drawer Interior Size: 10.8''D x 11.3''W x 2.1''H. Our console tables come with easy-to-follow and detailed instructions, and all hardware and components are perfectly labeled for easy assembly. If you have any questions about the item, please feel free to contact our customer service. We will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OXkMfPrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merax","source_asin":"B09K79W6PN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K79W6PN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K79W6PN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
