window.products.push({"id":338245,"name":"Traditional Chinese Painting on Rice Paper, Wall Decor, Oriental Art. Hand Painted, Ready to Frame. Color Options: White, Black, Green, Red, Yellow, P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ybm36EQSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stunning hand painted Chinese art. Chinese painting is one of the oldest continuous artistic style-also called \"Guohua\" meaning \"native painting\". Each piece is a unique art, strictly follows the traditional steps, using oldest ways to finish-the brush, water, ink, paint, hand made rice paper. This traditional ways require an artist both talent and experience so as to control the level of water in brush, the change of color during on stroke and the delicate paper's nature, etc. This finished work has no frame so as to keep the flexibility of decoration. In China, a traditional way is be to mounted on scrolls to hang on the wall (this service can be found in China town in most cities in US). It also can be framed, best with a glass on top to protect the paper. Another modern popular way recommended here: Table or art framing insert piece. Great gift for oriental culture enthusiasts, collectors. Guarantee: No duplication could be found anywhere. Size options: 27x18 Inch (Portrait) 39x20 Inch (Portrait) 39x20 Inch (Landscape) Stamp options: Stamped paintings are sold with stamps. Un-stamped paintings can be stamped if customer requires.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ybm36EQSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tian Art","source_asin":"B07L36N4JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L36N4JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L36N4JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
