window.products.push({"id":338267,"name":"YCWIWO Bamboo Charcoal Air Purifying 8 Pack Bags Natural Environmental Protection Health Charcoal Bags for Home Car Refrigerator Kitchen Clear Odor-fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91h0MnWn3cS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☘THE NATURAL DEODORISER：Bamboo charcoal bags don’t just ‘mask’ odors, they eliminate them.You can use bamboo charcoal bags just like air deodorizers or fresheners in your bathroom, bedroom, utility room, or any other room that requires odor elimination. You can even pop one in your fridge to help eliminate food odors, in your sports bag to remove that smelly sock odor, or you could use it in an area that your pet spends a lot of its time. 🏡NATURAL HOME AIR PURIFIER：Bamboo charcoal is dense and porous and can absorb irritants and pollutants. It has activated carbon which absorbs dust, pollen and pollutants from air and water due to the heat in it which drives out impurities and leaves room for the charcoal to absorb outside impurities. Bamboo charcoal makes for a great air filter and natural home air purifier. 🌿10X MORE POROUS：Air purifying bags with natural bamboo charcoal are 10x more porous than regular charcoal. That means when you buy our activated charcoal bag, you'll be getting one of natures’ most potent and effective charcoal air freshener solutions! Bamboo charcoal bags odor absorber means no more foul odors in your car, home, litter box, or gym bag. Supercharge the air you breathe! ♻SUSTAINABLE USE：charcoal bags last up to 2 years and can be placed just about anywhere to bring new freshness and a cleaner quality air to a home or your office, or even smaller areas such as closets and a pantry, even in a vehicle. They don’t bring in new fragrance, like some air fresheners do that just cover the odors up with toxins , Breathe Green just create cleaner air wherever they are used. 🌼VALUE-FOR-MONEY PACKAGING: We provide a total of 8 bags of charcoal air purification bags of 200g×4+80g×4. Therefore, please purchase according to your requirements. They are equipped with loops on the top and can be easily hung on a hanger or hook. Suitable for kitchen, bedroom, bathroom, closet, pet area, car, wardrobe, shoe rack, gym bag, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91h0MnWn3cS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YCWIWO","source_asin":"B089NNK3F9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NNK3F9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NNK3F9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
