window.products.push({"id":338319,"name":"PB 50 Pieces for 25 guests, Set Elegant Disposable Plastic Plates Gold Rim White, 25- Dinner Plates, 25- Dessert Plates, Heavy duty Premium Plates for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bLFQkw3bL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tumbler color - BLACK Our Black color Tumbler Mug has a modern design with a surface that has a pleasant tactile sensation to it, making it comfortable and convenient to hold. This mug was simply designed to be a life-long travel buddy. Our goal is to produce quality tumblers with a simple and smart design. We strive to satisfy your needs with the range of our quality products, which include insulated tumblers, bottles, cups and thermoses. You’ll be sure to ENJOY A CLEAN AND FRESH TASTE of your favorite drink from OUR stainless steel tumblers. No matter what climate you’re traveling in, our Tumblers are sure to contain the heat of your hot drink on your alpine hiking trips in the mountains or the keep your cold drink cool on your Sahara desert expeditions. Our Tumbler Mug was designed for: -Casual road trips -Hiking or backpacking trips -Hot days on the beach -Alpine hiking on snowy mountains -Also great for just drinking water -Your favorite smoothies -Mothers feeding their kids Our Tumbler Mugs were designed with the following features: - Designed with split proof lid that can be opened with one finger (The split proof lid is sealed with silicone keeping it air tight) - Lid is made with a durable plastic Our Tumbler Mugs have great additional features for keeping your life simple: -Designed with a hole on the magnetic lid, making sipping or fitting straws in convenient -Designed to fit any cup holder in your car Technological Features of our Tumbler Mugs include: - Designed to keep hot beverages hot for up to 6 hours - Designed to keep cold drinks cool for up 24 hours - Made with SEAMLESS Inner and outer DESIGN - Made from a DURABLE STAINLESS STEEL 18/8 - Produces no condensation - Made BPA free and from a non-toxic material, which is eco-friendly - Designed with a durable scratch proof Powder coating - Dishwash safe Dimensions: Diameter of lid: 3 1/2 inches Height: 6 7/8 inches Diameter of bottom: 6 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bLFQkw3bL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHOICE REVOLUTION","source_asin":"B00606LX54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00606LX54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00606LX54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338320,"name":"BarnwoodUSA | Wood Cake Stand | 15\"x15\" | Weathered Gray | Rustic Wooden Wedding Dessert Display Stand | Vintage Cupcake Stand | Farmhouse Wedding | A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lluTj+26L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH FARMHOUSE WEDDING DECOR; If you love the rustic look that farmhouse style decor adds to any event you are planning, then this set of 3 Rustic Wooden Cake Stand is the perfect accent piece for your Farmhouse Wedding. Perfectly built and designed to display your cake or cupcakes. It is made of sturdy 100⁒ Reclaimed and Recycled wood that will give you a worn, vintage aesthetic that will surely please your guests! Dimensions: Smallest box – 9 3/4″L x 9 3/4″W x 3\"H. Medium box – 12 3/4″L x 12 3/4″W x 3\"H. Largest Box – 15″L x 15″W x 3\"H. *Due to the rustic nature of the wood please be aware of splinters and random knots. GENUINE RECYCLED WOOD; Unlike other wood claiming to be upcycled, this Wedding Cake Display Box is made of genuine wood and are 100⁒ repurposed. Other companies may claim the wood they provide is recycled, but you can trust that with BarnwoodUSA products, all of the wood is reused. We love upcycled wood because it isn′t harsh on the environment and reduces waste. RUSTIC WOODEN DECOR; This decorative box unit will add country home decor to any event you are celebrating. Show off your incredible dessert with our beautifully handcrafted Wooden Display Boxes. It is truly a beautiful accent piece that will easily transform the atmosphere of your home or event for any occasion. ABOUT US; Here at BarnwoodUSA, we began working with national retailers to build a quality brand right here in the USA. This led our team to start the BarnwoodUSA line of frames, which grew to include a wide variety of home decor that is created with upcycled wood by our employees in Oklahoma City. Our mission is to take something old and forgotten and turn it into something beautiful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lluTj+26L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BarnwoodUSA","source_asin":"B0BMM69DHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMM69DHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMM69DHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
