window.products.push({"id":338389,"name":"11 oz Nosey Little Fucker, Aren't You Ceramic Coffee Mug by Moslion","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HV2Yi-edL._AC_.jpg","description":"Original and Thoughtful Gift Idea: Perfect and unique novelty gift during the holidays. Great for christmas, white elephant, secret santa, or any other occasion that will surely be remembered! Give To Someone You Love: Give this memorable gift to your Husband, Wife, Children, Brother, Sister, Family Member, Step Brother, Step Sister, Aunt, Uncle, Grandmother, Grandfather, Coworker, Partner, Significant Other, or Treat Yourself!This gift is something that they will treasure for years to come. A custom and thoughtful gift to make them remember the fun, and joy of the day when they received it. Best and Most Cost Effective Gift: Everyone needs to have a cup of tea, coffee, or any other beverage in the morning.Under a budget? Get the most bang for your buck with this gift under $20 and use it for years to come. Handmade To Order In The USA: We care about the products we produce. Our team ensures high quality products by using premium materials and careful production methods so your mug lasts for a long time.Designed and Manufactured in the United States Midwest. No Hassle Shipping: Packed and shipped securely and carefully using special foam cubes that have a <1% breakage rate.Sent from the middle of the United States so you receive it in perfect condition within 2-3 days. Many Other Product Designs Be sure to check out all our other funny, unique designs to find the right gift during your special occasion!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HV2Yi-edL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quick Mugs 2 U","source_asin":"B012PXHSMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012PXHSMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012PXHSMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338390,"name":"Nordic Ware Spring Lamb 3-D Cake Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81liCw7FFEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Start a fun Easter or springtime tradition with this innovative 3-D cake mold, which measures 7-1/2 by 11-1/4 by 3-1/2 inches. A deceptively simple way to create an amazingly detailed confection, the two-piece mold results in one adorable freestanding lamb cake that makes a stunning centerpiece for family gatherings or holiday celebrations. Furthermore, the baked cake can be frosted as realistically or simply as desired--with a bit of imagination and creativity, coconut flakes can become curly lamb fleece, chocolate chips or brown candies can be used as eyes, and tinted buttercream or a handful of pink sprinkles can instantly become soft little ear interiors. Finely crafted of cast aluminum, the mold features a nonstick finish that allows for easily removing the cake halves from its two sides. To use, simply brush with vegetable shortening and dust with flour prior to filling. Fill each half of the mold with any variety of cake batter, bake according to the packaging directions, and cool completely. Once removed from the mold, the cake halves can be joined with icing, cream-cheese frosting, or buttercream, and then decorated as desired. Made in the USA, the oven-safe pan should not be used with metal utensils, scouring pads, or abrasive cleaners, and it cleans up easily by hand with warm, soapy water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81liCw7FFEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nordic Ware","source_asin":"B000O5NR5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000O5NR5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000O5NR5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
