window.products.push({"id":338392,"name":"Blake Deluxe 7 Piece Bath Towel and Bath Mat Set - Densely Woven Premium Ultra Soft, High Absorbency Combed Cotton - Luxury Spa Bath Towels - 700 GSM ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y+xo2LWGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Combed Cotton GIVE YOUR BATHROOM A MAKEOVER: Premium 7 piece set includes everything you need to give your master bath or guest bath a quick freshen up: 2 Bath Towels (30” x 60”), 2 Hand Towels (16” x 28”), 2 Wash Cloths (12” x 12”), and 1 Bath Mat (20” x 32”). A DENSER WEAVE FOR ULTRA PLUSH ABSORBENCY: Treat yourself to some luxury. Our 700 GSM combed cotton towels set blends elegance and affordability to give you the rich feel of premium cotton at prices attractive enough for every day of the year. THICK, HIGH QUALITY TOWELS: Your family is going to love stepping out of a bath or shower and wrapping themselves in the luxurious softness and warmth of our deluxe bath towels. The plush bath mat is super absorbent and feels rich between your toes. CARE FOR YOUR TOWELS: Wash your towels before the first use to remove any excess lint leftover from the manufacturing process. Always wash your towels separately to avoid transfer of lint onto your garments. Machine wash warm with mild detergent and tumble dry low. We advise against the use of fabric softeners which may reduce absorbency and may cause discoloration. BONUS LAUNDRY BAG INCLUDED: Your new Bloom Bath Towels by Bumble will arrive at your door wrapped in our signature elegant canvas carry bag that can be used again and again. Take your towels with you to the pool, beach, and even the gym.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y+xo2LWGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bumble Towels","source_asin":"B07MCY7CS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MCY7CS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MCY7CS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338393,"name":"The Bishop Cotton Full/Queen Size Duvet Cover Set, 800 Thread Count Soft 100% Egyptian Cotton Cool, Comfortable & Breathable, Home Decor Set 3 Piece I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+rqB0MClL._AC_.jpg","description":"♥ Welcome to the World of Luxurious Duvet in soft sateen and durable long-staple Cotton. We at The Bishop Cotton Believe in happy customers and best customer services Possible. Our 100% Egyptian Cotton 800 Thread Count Duvet Sets are the true definition of luxury and comfort. Why is Egyptian cotton so much better for your Duvet? Quite simply, Egyptian cotton produces longer fibers (up to twice as long as a standard cotton fiber). The longer fibers or staples are easily spun into finer count yarns and turned into the softest Duvet you will ever sleep on. It's that simple! \"Ply\" refers to the number of yarns wrapped together in a single thread. The process of plying creates thicker threads, which will impact a sheet's feel and durability. Finer threads allow for higher thread counts resulting in a softer sheet with an elegant drape. Our Single ply Duvet use individual, un-plied threads in the weaving process, resulting in lightweight fabric with exceptional drape and softness. Make your bed more beautiful and comfortable than ever with the 1000 Thread Count 100% Egyptian Cotton Luxury Sheet Set! You won't find luxury at this price anywhere else! We are excited to bring you luxury in the endeavor to make your overall health the best it can be. Our Egyptian Cotton has a feeling of relaxation, peace, luxury and comfort within its threads. Here's to peaceful, ultimate Sleep.Click on \"Add to Cart\" and enjoy the luxuriousness of The Bishop Cotton ♥","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+rqB0MClL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bishop Cotton","source_asin":"B0C4PVNJJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4PVNJJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4PVNJJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338394,"name":"Varmax Prelit Chrismas Tree Glitter Tabletop Tree Bottle Brush Trees 13.8'', Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jGQcOcePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Christmas Tabletop Tree】The tree is made of PVC snowy tips with glitter, iron base and lamp string. Create detailed Christmas atmosphere in your table. 【Size】The tall tree is 13.8'' height and 3.8'' width; the short tree is 9.4'' height and 4.3'' width. 【Pre-lit】The gold tree is pre-lit with 30 LED warm lights, the silk tree is 25 LED cool lights, and the green tree is 35 shining colorful lights. And there are only 3 AAA Batteries needed (not included) for every tree. 【Flocked Trees】It would be a good option to make a flocked trees with different size and color of tree. Separated item is more suitable for small table. 【Glitter Reminded】There will be some glitters falling down when move or shake the tree. It is a normal situation and the glitter will stop falling when the item is static.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jGQcOcePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Varmax","source_asin":"B07Z4NSMFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z4NSMFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z4NSMFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
