window.products.push({"id":338402,"name":"TENTA Kitchen Multi Kitchen Utensil Slotted Fish Turner Spatula for Kitchen (Stainless Steel Cooking Set of 11)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mTGWm4faL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Suited to any kitchen, Tenta Kitchen is the professional kitchen utensils set you could ask for. Crafted with 100% stainless steel materials, these timeless stainless steel utensil set are beautiful housewarming gifts. skimmer, slotted spatula, slotted ladles, pasta server, condiment spoon or rice spoon,soup ladles,food strainer, fish turner, food tongs, you have everything you need to cook masterful meals. Our 11-piece premium kitchen utensils are crafted with high-quality stainless steel are designed to last, quality full stainless steel cooking utensils that do the heavy lifting for you,That means no more constantly replacing that kitchen tool that melted when you left it on the grilled cheese pan too long! No more awful plastic melting into your food! With this steel utensil set, you’ll always have the right tool at hand and all your useful kitchen gadgets will last for years to come. Bring out your inner chef with this elegant kitchen tool kit that makes you own your kitchen. There is nothing better than that moment when you’ve got the right spatula or semi-auto wire whisk in your hand for the very first time and you realize the secret of cooking is in the right tool for the job. We remember the first time we discovered the right spatula to flip an omelet. Game changer. We hope you just are amazing chef after you got TENTA KITCHEN'S baking utensil. At Tenta Kitchen, we believe there is a better and efficient way, we hope to make things simpler, easier, more thoughtfully designed to do better.we wanted to create the feeling of being a pampered chef without the price tag. We wanted kitchen tools that made us feel like hotel Chefs! 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - At Tenta Kitchen, we are dedicated to your satisfaction. If you're ever unsatisfied with the performance of your metal stainless steel kitchen utensils set, we'll replce you a new one , no questions asked! Click \"Add to Cart\" now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mTGWm4faL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TENTA TENTA KITCHEN","source_asin":"B07PNLZVQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PNLZVQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PNLZVQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
