window.products.push({"id":338429,"name":"Skimming Swan by Lois Bryan, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SqswKOywL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece a swan near water. Lois Bryan describes herself as a 10-year old little kid, cleverly disguised as a 'woman of a certain age'..ordinary, garden-variety, happily married photography Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SqswKOywL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D0ZAXDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D0ZAXDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D0ZAXDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338430,"name":"CKSUNG Under Sink Organizers and Storage, 2 Tier Pull-out Under Bathroom and Kitchen Cabinet Storage Drawer Organizer With 4 Hook 1 Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MNriHqWRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Updated Sliding Drawers Design】Upgrade sliding drawer organizer allows you easier access what's hiding in the back of your sink and solve the trouble of bending over to find things. The bottom slide-out drawer design will make picking and taking more flexible and easier in limited space. 【Sturdy Stability Construction】The under sink storage is made of high-quality ABS plastic material, and the 4 support tubes are painted and thickened with the wrought iron body. Well-made and extremely sturdy, does not rust or tarnish, durable and high load carrying capacity, can serve you for a long time. 【Multifunctional Under Cabinet Storage】This under sliding cabinet organizer can be used in the bathroom to store shower gel and shampoo, in the kitchen to store ingredients and condiments, in the dressing table to store skincare products and cosmetics, in the laundry room, kitchen soap, laundry detergent, and in the storage of children's toys. 【Saving Storage Space】Two-layer under sink drawers storage can solve the storage problem under the cabinet and improve the utilization rate of the limited sink space. Comes with 4 extra hooks and 1 hanging cup which makes the maximum use of storage space. 【Easy to Install and Clean】Under bathroom sink organizers and storage can be completed and installed without using tools. And the hollow design used under the under sink storage sink will not accumulate water, and it can be wiped directly when cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MNriHqWRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CKSUNG","source_asin":"B0BXKVS9PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXKVS9PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXKVS9PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
