window.products.push({"id":338447,"name":"Bamboo charcoal air purifying bag | 2 HEAVY-DUTY, LARGE FLAT (2x350g) CHARCOAL BAGS odor absorber | Activated bamboo charcoal bags | Odor eliminator f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zb19AcyrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY OUR BAGS? They are THREE TIMES LARGER with 75% MORE activated charcoal chunks than most charcoal bag odor absorbers. Just one of our bamboo charcoal bags does the work of 2-4 of the competition. CHUNKED CHARCOAL is most effective in an odor absorber for strong odors. With more activated charcoal chunks in each charcoal air purifying bag ours has clear advantage. NON-TOXIC. FRAGRANCE-FREE. SUSTAINABLY SOURCED bamboo charcoal is a natural odor eliminating solution. No harsh sprays or chemicals. 100% NATURAL. NO LARGE LABELS. Labels block air flow critical to an effective charcoal air purifying bag. Nothing gets in the way of great performance. FLAT SHAPE bags are easier to keep out of sight while EXTRA-LARGE provides extra odor absorber power. Our bags are 13.5” x 7.5” and less than 1” thick. They fit where other charcoal deodorizer bags won’t. Grommets centered on each end to mount or hang without losing its slim shape. HEAVY-DUTY. Superior construction. Strong, open weave linen exterior and inner pockets make an odor remover for house, your house. Those inner pockets are there so the bamboo charcoal won’t bulk up when hung. The bag keeps its slim shape. Even slim enough to mount under your kitchen cabinet for hidden odor eliminating power. RECHARGEABLE. Lay the bag in direct sunlight for a few hours and the bamboo will release and recharge, ready to absorb more odor and moisture for up to 2 years. THE REAL DEAL. We don’t photoshop our bags into scenes. Our photos were taken with our charcoal bags in real use. We cut open a bag to show activated charcoal chunks for superior odor and moisture absorbers. COUNTLESS USES. Not only odor absorbers for home, our charcoal deodorizer bags are designed to be the Bubba Gump of odor eliminator for strong odors - a pet odor eliminator, car odor eliminator, closet odor eliminator, laundry odor eliminator, bathroom odor eliminator, kitchen odor eliminator, refrigerator odor eliminator, trash can odor eliminator, diaper pail odor eliminator, hockey bag odor eliminator, gym bag odor eliminator, RV odor eliminator – a charcoal air purifying bag for any need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zb19AcyrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ree Inspired","source_asin":"B08QYLLJ42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QYLLJ42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QYLLJ42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
