window.products.push({"id":338639,"name":"3x Neck Support Pillows for Pain Relief Sleeping, Improve Sleep Cervical Memory Foam Pillows Adjustable, Odorless Ergonomic Orthopedic Pillow, Cooling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.81,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LcEWh8aSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONTOUR PRO! PAINLESS SLEEP! With upgraded neck contour shaped by chiropractors, our cervical pillows provide 3x support, effectively release the pressure and muscle tension, resulting in an 80% reduction in neck/shoulder pain. The shallow center cavity and adjustable loft of neck pillow for pain relief cradle your head gently and never pitch your skull forward at an awkward angle. It ensures proper alignment of your spine in every sleep position! Ready to tackle your day without sore and stiff! LARGE AREA, MORE COMFORTABLE! Compared to those sleeping pillows with butterfly design, our bed pillow has more room on each side for side sleepers to lay head comfortably. The shoulder side panels are adjusted to 60°, leaving more space to stretch your shoulder cozily. Simple ergonomic curve helps adapt your first contour pillow faster and enjoy it sooner. Ergonomic pillow aligns your head and neck to keep the airway open and help your breathing. Sleep soundly! Give you a Healthy Sleeping. ADJUSTABLE LOFT, NEVER LIMIT YOUR SLEEPING STYLE! Why settle for a plain old pillow when you can adjust one to your liking? Our memory foam pillows have 3 different lofts to keep the natural curve of your spine in back, side stomach sleeping. Just rotate orthopedic pillow to enjoy them（5.1''& 4.8\"& 3.5\") The removable insert also gives it a wider adjustment range than other neck support pillows. Simply contact us if you need more insert! Whatever way you sleep, Vavedic will meet your all needs! BREATHABLE & ODORLESS, NEVER LOST SHAPE! Using innovative technology, our memory foam is capable of automatically adjusting its shape according to the body curve and temperature, providing the most even and true support. Certified with CERTIPUR-US & OEKO-TEX, pillow for neck pain sleeping is non-toxic and durable enough to never get flat! Our orthopedic pillow with open-cell memory foam and 3D mesh pillowcase allows for airflow throughout the pillow and provide a cooling and dry night's sleep! FRIENDLY CUSTOMER SERVICE, PURCHASE WITH CONFIDENCE! Our neck pillows for pain relief sleeping are designed to help solve the woes of unhappy sleepers and come in adjustable height to support those that have different body shapes. It is also an ideal gift for people suffering from headaches, neck pain, military neck, cramped shoulder by relieving pressure and promoting spine alignment. If you have any problem, please feel free to contact us, and we will provide you with a satisfying experience","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LcEWh8aSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAVEDIC","source_asin":"B0BWXGWYBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWXGWYBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWXGWYBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
