window.products.push({"id":338705,"name":"100 Pack Mylar Bags for Food Storage with Oxygen Absorbers – 1 Gallon, 1 Quart & 1/2 Pint - Resealable Stand Up Ziplock Pouches Bag Heat Sealable Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BdJkD1AkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL IN ONE SET - Mylar bags for food storage with oxygen absorbers includes: 25pcs 1 Gallon mylar bags for food storage (10\"x14\"), 35pcs 1 Quart resealable food storage bags (7\"x10\"), 40pcs 1/2 Pint mylar ziplock bags (5\"x7\"), 100pcs oxygen absorber for food storage (400cc each), 120pcs stick on labels, suitable for a wide range of food storage FOOD GRADE MATERIAL & THICKER THICKNESS - Our mylar bags with oxygen absorbers are made with food-grade materials that are safe, eco-friendly, durable and tasteless. The thickness of mylar food storage bags is 8.7 mil, one side is as thick as 4.35 mil. The foil pouch bag provides excellent durability and puncture resistance, which is airtight, smell proof, light proof and leakage that can prevent light and air permeation to keep your food into the mylar storage bags for a longer period PREMIUM 300CC OXYGEN ABSORBERS & STICK-ON LABELS – The oxygen absorbers for food storage comes with a vacuum sealed pouch that can reduce product exposure and waste effectively. With 300cc oxygen absorbers, it will remove oxygen faster, which can keep your food fresh and storage longer. Please seal the separate oxygen absorbers ASAP after packaging. With stick on stickers, you can not only mark and distinguish the content put in easily, but also keep your organization much neater. STAND UP DESIGN WITH RESEALABLE ZIPLOCK - Our 8.7 Mil mylar vacuum seal bags are designed with a gusset bottom and zipper. You can fill and organize the fillings more easily. Beside this, the standing type can simplify the storage of your cabinet perfectly. With the zipper design, the smell proof bag can be used repeatedly, which is convenient for foods that are often eaten. EASY TO USE AND SEAL - The smell proof bag has a U-shaped tear on the side for easy opening. The food storage bags can be also sealable with vacuum sealer machine, hair straightener, impulse sealer or household iron. The heat sealable bags can prevent your food from exposure to air, light, odors, and moisture. These resealable mylar bags can be resealed and recycled after opening WIDELY USED - Used to dehydrate food for storage like cereals, coffee beans, rice, flour, oats, dried flowers, baking, dried fruit, cookies, tea, nuts, cosmetic, soap, emergency long term food storage and so on","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BdJkD1AkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yuervson","source_asin":"B0BG67D8MS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG67D8MS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG67D8MS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
