window.products.push({"id":338774,"name":"Leggett & Platt Carlisle Upholstered Headboard with Adjustable Height and Sloping Nailhead Trim, Grande Pearl Finish, King / California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BgBjRH4wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Carlisle is a beautifully upholstered headboard that will complement a variety of room décors, from contemporary to traditional. Constructed with a solid wood interior frame for stability and years of everyday use, this headboard is upholstered in a Grande Pearl finished 100% polyester fabric. This bedroom piece is elegantly designed with a softly arched top with nailhead trim to emphasize the color and make this a perfect centerpiece for your bedroom. The soft fabric also sets the stage for comfort and relaxation. The walnut finished headboard posts are also adjustable, allowing the user to switch headboard levels from 45-inches to 49-inches to 53-inches in height. This (3) level option is a convenient way to create a new bedroom look with just the slightest headboard adjustment. A good ornamental headboard, like the Carlisle, will fuse with the surrounding décor and transform a room from ordinary into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit includes a headboard panel, posts, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Carlisle Headboard comes with a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BgBjRH4wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B076BDBDN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BDBDN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BDBDN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
