window.products.push({"id":338778,"name":"The Original Butter Bell Crock and Spreader by L. Tremain, Parisian Polka Dot Collection - Black/White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xqFRa+w5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FLAVOR AND FRESHNESS - Modeled after the original French butter crock, The Original Butter Bell Crock by L. Tremain keeps butter fresh and spreadable for up to 30 days without refrigeration; no odors or spoilage. Two-piece design features an inverted bell-shaped lid and crock bottom for serving butter at the table, and protecting and storing the butter after each use. IRRESISTABLE CHIC PARISIAN DESIGN - Give your kitchen an irresistible chic Parisian look with this Parisian Polka Dot Collection Butter Bell Crock and Spreader set by L. Tremain. Featuring the word \"butter\" in English and French \"beurre\" etched onto each side of the butter dish in a raised relief design with a creamy white finish. Colorful piping and whimsical polka-dotted spreader handles make a stylish mix of French country practicality and chic city style. DURABLE HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL - Made of highly durable new bone china that keeps butter fresh and spreadable without refrigeration. New bone china is a high grade mixture of liquid clay poured into a pre-cast plaster mold, then allowed to set for several hours. When dry, the Butter Bells are carefully removed from the mold, glazed and fired at 2200 degrees to create a durable and scratch resistant finish. EASY TO USE FOR FRESH BUTTER - Pour cold water into the base, pack dry lid with softened butter, then add the lid to water-filled base, creating an airtight seal that preserves the butter’s flavor and freshness. Replace water in the base every 2-3 days for fresh, flavorful butter. ENHANCE YOUR KITCHEN - Conveniently sized crock holds one stick of butter, the equivalent of one-half cup, and fits neatly on your countertop as a stylish accent to any décor. Dishwasher safe, free of lead and cadmium.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xqFRa+w5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butter Bell","source_asin":"B00AC7ZRKE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AC7ZRKE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AC7ZRKE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
