window.products.push({"id":338853,"name":"Zulay 10-Piece Crab Crackers and Tools Set - Heavy Duty Crab Leg Crackers and Tools & Sharp Tines - Sturdy Lobster Crackers and Picks Set For Opening ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y351MEelL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Seafood Feast Essentials: If you're a big fan of seafood boils then you're used to the fact that crabs and lobsters' crustacean's hard shell is very tough to crack. Therefore, owning a proper tool like the Zulay Kitchen Lobster Cracker and Picks Set will make your seafood journey much more enjoyable and less laborious. Set comes with 2 crackers and 8 lobster picks Strong & Durable Construction: The cracker is made from premium quality chrome plated zinc alloy that is durable, heavy-duty, and built to last making it ideal for opening crab, lobster, selected nuts, and more! The combination of interior teeth grooves and a sturdy handle result in an effortless meat extraction minus the hand fatigue that you often experience when using hands through the opening process. 2 in 1 Function Picks: The lobster picks are made from top-grade rust resistant stainless steel that is designed with small sharp tines and a flat scooper that lets you get meat out of the seafood shell swiftly. Great For Seafood Lovers: Whether you’re planning to do some take out of your local seafood restaurant, or cook a showstopper seafood boil that can be savored and enjoyed at your family dinner—then having dedicated crackers and picks that are light enough to be easy on the hands but heavy enough to break the meaty claws is such a deal! No Hassle, Kitchen Happiness Zulay Guarantee: We love and take pride in our Lobster Crackers and Picks Set, and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. If there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed. If it does not, we‘ve got you covered (even after the Amazon return window). Chances are, you will never need to reach out!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y351MEelL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B08BXCNCCV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BXCNCCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BXCNCCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
