window.products.push({"id":338919,"name":"Scott Living Cotton Rich Tencel 6-Piece Towel Set | Rainy Day Gray | Absorbent | Super Soft | Quick Dry | Strong | Durable | Designer Home Bath Towels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1kafwVWUXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After renovating houses for hundreds of families, hosts of HGTV’s “Property Brothers” Drew and Jonathan Scott know how to make a home work for everyone – and that includes high-quality home furnishings, textiles and décor that look great and fit your needs. Scott Living by Drew & Jonathan reflects their commitment to help you create the perfect space for the people you love. With the Scott Brothers’ latest collection featuring modern and nature-inspired patterns, you’re sure to make a statement. A DESIGNER LOOK TO LOVE in a 57% Cotton, 26% TENCEL Lyocell, 17% Polyester tri-blend bath towel set. Made to last, these 600 GSM weight towels absorb quickly adding a luxurious staple to the bathroom. Choose from a range of solid color options to easily coordinate with any bathroom decor or a season refresh. Machine washable for easy care and sustainably sourced. Six piece set Includes: 2 Bath Towels (30in x 54in) each, 2 Hand Towels (16in x 30in) each, 2 Wash Cloths (13in x 13in) each. MUST HAVE FEATURES, Our contemporary bath towels are constructed for everyday performance with added designer home luxury. Wrap up in plush softness in a highly absorbing fiber blend that dries quickly, maintains both strength and durability even after multiple washes. Crafted in a zero-twist, looped terry body with 2 inch dobby detail, paired with clean edges for a tailored look. Clean lines, quality materials and easy care deliver a designer bathroom towel set for your bathroom. CAREFULLY DESIGNED, Scott Living home products are better for you, your family, and the planet. Our products are Oeko-Tex Made in Green Certified. They have met high environmental safety standards and are tested for harmful substances. Our sustainable products are manufactured under environmentally friendly and socially responsible working conditions. Our cotton blended textiles feature sustainably sourced fibers that are environmentally friendly as cotton fibers are naturally biodegradable. EASY CARE, Wash before use. Machine wash warm with like colors. Gentle cycle. Use non-chlorine bleach when needed. Avoid use of fabric softener. Tumble dry low. Do not iron. Do not dry clean. We stand by our product and offer a 30-DAY \"LOVE-IT\" GUARANTEE, \"We're not happy unless you're happy\". We recommend for an added polished look, pair or gift with other Scott Living luxury home products. Each sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1kafwVWUXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Living","source_asin":"B09NLS4MKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NLS4MKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NLS4MKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
