window.products.push({"id":338993,"name":"HYZ Heavy Duty Chrome Waiter Corkscrew Wine Opener with Foil Cutter,  Professional 4Pack Wine Key for Bartenders and Waiter, Multi Colored Bottle Open","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xUb61Qv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTITOOL WINE OPENER: Classical double hinged lever help you pull the cork from the wine bottle with no effort; The bottle opener opens bottle of the beer, soft drinks, soda water, coca cola. Foldable foil cutter can not only remove any foil style but can be used as a knife for other purposes like tab opener for cans, slicing the sealed bag etc. Everything you need to open a bottle of wine or beer is conveniently available to you in one tool. BUILD TO LAST: Strengthened heavy duty stainless steel has even reached the commercial grade. Thick, well-mounted, and not bendable screw can hold up well bottle after bottle for years. Can handle an old, natural, fragile or synthetic cork very well. Specially designed for waiters, sommeliers, bartenders and every wine enthusiast and has already got many full time bartender's approve. UNIQUE CHROME DESIGN: This upgraded old fashioned corkscrew become not only more durable but also more stylish. Chrome finish is highly reflective for a mirror-like look that make this wine opener more elegant than those similar waiter corkscrew. Ergonomically designed handle is for your comfort. Slim figure for easy storage, also perfect for picnics, road trips, and travel. INCLUDES 4 MULTI COLORED OPENERS: Each one is in single white box and then 4 all in outer box with instructions. Set of 4 makes them very affordable, without sacrificing quality, for commercial restaurant use or to keep one at home, keep one in RV, and give one to your friend or relative. Well packaged also makes them a great gift item or party favor for any occasion for the wine lover. BASED ON CUSTOMER: HYZ aim to provide quality at reasonable prices and we also offer friendly after-sale support to every customer. Though all HYZ products are under strict quality system, if you unluckily receive the defective items, please contact us at any time. Our customers support will reply to you in time. HYZ will be responsible for any quality issues. Please buy with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xUb61Qv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HYZ","source_asin":"B0BP1T812F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP1T812F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP1T812F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":338994,"name":"Wall Floating Shelf - 24 X 6 X 1 1/4\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e8GM+Ah4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Overall Dimensions: 23\" L X 6\" W X 1 1/4\" H Wooden You Shelving manufactures the highest quality shelves and shelving systems on the market. Our light weight floating shelves provide customers more weight support than traditional floating shelves, and provides a true wood grain look competitors cannot match. The Wooden You Shelving system is known for the incredibly large amount of weight our systems hold so we have made sure our floating shelves support more weight than any other floating shelf on the market. **Reivew the stain graph and choose the stain you would like applied to your floating shelf. In the notes section type the name of the stain you would like, or message us letting us know which stain you would like**","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e8GM+Ah4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wooden You Shelving","source_asin":"B004VRQKOI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-338994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004VRQKOI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004VRQKOI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
